<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST387"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, July 05, 2004 - 10:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, if you want to go down in the history books, turn yourself in and let the history lesson get started. Old fashioned pens will be scratching and modern computers will be whirring with information. Can you imagine the emails and telephone calls that will be generated by your confession? Please do it now. We are waiting for you... <BR>-flytodeb<!--/Text--></td></tr>
