<!--Post: 395--><!--Time: 1089225874-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST395"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jaden<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, July 07, 2004 - 11:44 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey BTK, <BR> <BR>You are dying anyway. You know it and I know it. I do not feel sorry for you. They are on your tail now. You are the ultimate PU$$Y. Killing little children and women. Masturbating over thier lifeless bodies. SICK, SICK, SICK! <BR> <BR>You better hop on your private plane and get the heck outta the desert. Tick, Tick, Tick, Tick... Time is not on your side. Coleman covered a hell of a lot for you. They are singing like birds now.  <BR> <BR>Feel the hot breath of justcie on your neck? I just bet you do! <BR> <BR>Your Priest will not have enough Hail Mary&#39;s to gain God&#39;s forgiveness. What a good Catholic you are, Coach.  <BR> <BR>Jaden<!--/Text--></td></tr>
