</a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 22, 2004 - 7:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK Please do turnyourself  in.  This is not a game tp hide behind. 5 people are dead at your hand.  Or so we are led to believe.  Actually, I think you are a fake and didn&#39;t kill anyone.  So you need help.  Please contact that attorney.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
