<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST886"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->One Big Ho Hum!<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, August 24, 2004 - 11:13 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->So BTK you are 1 big question mark.  And that is not even original.  You seemed to have borrowed that too. Just like all your other messages and deeds.  Experts have mentioned the Zodiac killer and David Berkowitz.  At least David Berkowitz stood up and took resposibility for what he did. <BR>Like Zodiac, you can&#39;t even stand the light of day, because everyone would know you for what you are.  Stand up and take responsibility.  You have already had a criminal lawyer offer you help, shakey as that may be. Unlike MMEad I do not think you are wise.  You are playing a dangerous game.  If you like imitaing, imitate David Berkowitz.  Change your life and make a more postive difference. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
